c_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv5ZM5p22M5EyHK25uvctvw4Bfk-P4Zgms3U7odm8pcxA&oe=69984A7E"}, {"file_name": "BlindSimulator_Stair.png", "id": "4044188659173246", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391885_4044188662506579_7546195151401081343_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4L6KkgRN6lwQ7kNvwEy2ES3&_nc_oc=AdnMQBnCCLjt1fMqIjDbtgzoUSs7dJ64yLZEBFLMTeMoYDH_qmARQ0zgXcO15_DSDVE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftnukJ_TCyYm6V60fwt3Roh4pO1tp6mb8o8op79yXTBYw&oe=699842DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "BlindSimulator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**'Blind Simulator'** is a VR simulation game that offers a unique perspective by allowing players to experience the world as a blind person.\n\nPlayers begin the game without sight and must rely on a white cane as their only tool to explore their surroundings.\nTapping the cane on the ground creates a sonar effect, which temporarily reveals the shapes and objects in the nearby space.\n\nOn the journey to a hospital, players use public transportation such as buses and subways, and navigate crowded streets and unfamiliar environments \u2014 all within a fully virtual, safe-to-experience setting.\nThrough this process'**how to sense and understand the world without directly seeing it**'.\n\nThis game goes beyond a simple simulation \u2014 it conveys the everyday discomforts and fears faced by people with visual impairments.\nIt is designed with an educational purpose and presents a narrative-driven VR experience that resonates with players.\n\n**Start a new kind of exploration where you learn to \"see without seeing\" \u2014 using sound, vibration, and spatial awareness as your only guides.**", "short_description": "Experience the journey of a blind person navigating the world using only sound and touch in immersive VR."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.blindsimula